  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "JAMSTEC Rock Samples Database of Ocean Floor",
  "description": "JAMSTEC Rock Samples Database of Ocean Floor contains rock samples collected by submersibles in the surrounding waters of Japan.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To understand changes in the deep seafloor from the past to present, and the relationship between physical, chemical, biological, and geological phenomena accompanying those changes, with the hope of furthering our comprehensive understanding of deep-sea mechanisms.",
